# the screen's theme (GLO, Setup KNOB 4): Dark by default, Light sand and ink; every part of the screen
# redraws at once, and it's kept over a restart. The header shows the version.
# (params: 40 Theme; luma: brightness at (2, row): 2 the header, 60 beside the pan, 200 the knobs)
wait 50
tap GLO
expect view 10
expect par40 0
wait 50
expect luma2 <40
expect luma200 <40
shot setup_dark.png
spin K4 1
expect par40 1
wait 50
expect luma2 >200
expect luma60 >200
expect luma200 >200
shot setup_light.png
tap HOME
tapkey w8
tapkey w6
wait 50
expect luma2 >200
shot home_light.png
tap SAVE
reboot
expect par40 1
tapkey w8
wait 50
expect luma2 >200
shot light.png
tap GLO
spin K4 -1
expect par40 0
wait 50
expect luma60 <40
